  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4803.01 Oil Discharge and Pollution Control License Required. Any person importing oil shall first procure a license from the bureau pursuant to RSA 146-A:11-b and Saf-C 4303.\n\nSource. #6006, eff 3-24-95, EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #8103, INTERIM, eff 6-18-04, EXPIRES: 12-15-04; ss by #8151, eff 8-30-04; ss and moved by #9380, eff 1-30-09 (from Saf-C 4802.01); ss by #10022, eff 11-9-11; ss by #13039, eff 4-20-20",
